Attune yourself to the endless hunger of distant dead suns.  For the next [3, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] turns, your attacks will inflict an additional [29, 39, 46, 53, 58 (TL1-5; SP 100)] gravity damage and attempt to pull enemies closer.  After three turns, you will recover half of all damage taken during this effect.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
